WEBVTT

1
00:01:17.872 --> 00:01:21.313
A hundred years ago,
all was right with our world.

2
00:01:21.444 --> 00:01:24.419
Prosperity and peace filled our days.

3
00:01:24.549 --> 00:01:26.084
The four Nations:

4
00:01:26.217 --> 00:01:32.057
Water, Earth, fire and Air Nomads
lived amongst each other in harmony.

5
00:01:32.186 --> 00:01:36.931
Great respect was aflorded to all those
who could bend their natural element.

6
00:01:37.061 --> 00:01:41.068
The Avatar was the only person
born amongst all the nations

7
00:01:41.199 --> 00:01:43.935
who could master all four elements.

8
00:01:44.066 --> 00:01:48.008
He was the only one who could
communicate with the Spirit World.

9
00:01:48.137 --> 00:01:52.678
With the Spirits' guidance,
the Avatar kept balance in the world.

10
00:01:53.478 --> 00:01:57.417
And then, a hundred years ago,
he just disappeared.

11
00:02:00.418 --> 00:02:04.458
<i><b>Re-Sync by tebawihi</b></i>

12
00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.053
l'm sorry. l'm sorry!

13
00:02:36.185 --> 00:02:38.156
Hey, l'm sorry.
l'm sorry, l'm sorry, l'm sorry!

14
00:02:38.288 --> 00:02:42.263
l'm sorry! l'm sorry! Hey!
It worked better that time.

15
00:02:42.393 --> 00:02:45.865
l thought about Mom. Isn't that strange?

16
00:02:47.132 --> 00:02:50.135
Yeah. l guess so.

17
00:02:50.466 --> 00:02:54.742
Just stop doing that stuff around me.
l always get wet.

18
00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.349
My brother and l live
in the Southern Water Tribe,

19
00:03:01.479 --> 00:03:06.087
which was once a big city.
Our father is off fighting in The War.

20
00:03:06.416 --> 00:03:09.557
My mother was taken prisoner
and killed when l was young.

21
00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:13.695
ln this time of war, food is scarce.

22
00:03:13.825 --> 00:03:15.993
My brother and l often
go hunting for food,

23
00:03:16.126 --> 00:03:20.335
but, unfortunately, my brother
isn"t the best hunter in the world.

24
00:03:25.005 --> 00:03:27.174
- Tiger seal.
- Are you sure?

25
00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.533
l did everything Dad said to do.

26
00:03:52.666 --> 00:03:55.036
l watched which side of the fin tracks
are more indented.

27
00:03:55.169 --> 00:03:56.636
That shows which
direction they're going.

28
00:03:56.768 --> 00:04:00.475
l saw how long the drag skids are.
That shows you how fast they're going.

29
00:04:08.849 --> 00:04:10.482
There's something under there.

30
00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:28.236
lt's a cave-in!
Move away from the cracks!

31
00:04:55.863 --> 00:05:00.973
Katara, don't go near it.
This is probably some Fire Nation trick.

32
00:05:01.769 --> 00:05:04.772
Just back away really slow.

33
00:05:10.779 --> 00:05:12.949
Katara! Do not hit that sphere!

34
00:05:28.163 --> 00:05:29.666
Uncle, look!

35
00:06:10.173 --> 00:06:11.605
ls he breathing?

36
00:06:14.876 --> 00:06:17.449
Did you see that light
shoot into the sky?

37
00:06:18.081 --> 00:06:19.281
What's your name?

38
00:06:20.349 --> 00:06:24.355
How did you get here?
How did you get in the ice?

39
00:06:25.185 --> 00:06:26.857
He's exhausted.

40
00:06:28.189 --> 00:06:30.359
We need to get him back to the village.

41
00:06:37.431 --> 00:06:38.433
What is this thing?

42
00:06:43.437 --> 00:06:45.108
lt's trying to eat me!

43
00:06:53.082 --> 00:06:54.985
Look. See?

44
00:07:06.493 --> 00:07:08.130
How'd you get all the way out here?

45
00:07:08.898 --> 00:07:10.301
l ran away from home.

46
00:07:10.833 --> 00:07:14.440
We got in a storm. We were forced
under the water of the ocean.

47
00:07:14.569 --> 00:07:16.308
l see.

48
00:07:16.441 --> 00:07:19.143
lt wasn't very smart. l was just upset.

49
00:07:20.142 --> 00:07:22.078
- Thanks for saving me.
- Lucky.

50
00:07:22.679 --> 00:07:25.650
l probably should get home.
They'll all be worried.

51
00:07:25.781 --> 00:07:28.921
- You're not still upset?
- Not as much as l was.

52
00:07:46.769 --> 00:07:47.906
The Fire Nation is here.

53
00:07:48.036 --> 00:07:49.907
- What?
- And they brought their machines.

54
00:07:52.075 --> 00:07:54.449
Don't come out
till l tell you it's safe.

55
00:07:56.247 --> 00:08:00.219
- Is something wrong?
- No. Please wait here.

56
00:08:00.349 --> 00:08:03.857
- Hurry, now!
- Secure the area!

57
00:08:15.663 --> 00:08:17.769
lt can't be coincidence
that we break him out of the ice,

58
00:08:17.901 --> 00:08:21.477
light shoots into the sky and now the
Fire Nation is here with their machines.

59
00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:34.820
Sokka, don't.

60
00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.898
l am Prince Zuko...

61
00:08:46.464 --> 00:08:50.674
...son of Fire Lord Ozai
and heir to the throne!

62
00:08:52.404 --> 00:08:54.976
Bring me all your elderly!

63
00:08:55.107 --> 00:08:56.942
- Papa!
- Move!

64
00:08:57.074 --> 00:08:58.142
Yeah?

65
00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.350
Grandma!

66
00:09:08.086 --> 00:09:10.691
Please don't... don't harm him!

67
00:09:11.989 --> 00:09:13.358
Come on!

68
00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.698
Katara, don't.

69
00:09:20.264 --> 00:09:22.936
- Form a line!
- Come on!

70
00:09:27.206 --> 00:09:28.409
Here.

71
00:09:29.274 --> 00:09:30.477
Hey.

72
00:09:44.123 --> 00:09:45.824
Grammy!

73
00:09:48.294 --> 00:09:49.628
You're scaring these people.

74
00:09:57.504 --> 00:09:59.572
Who are you? What's your name?!

75
00:09:59.704 --> 00:10:02.743
- l don't need to tell you anything.
- Firebenders!

76
00:10:07.881 --> 00:10:09.750
l'm taking you to my ship.

77
00:10:10.249 --> 00:10:14.088
lf you don't come,
l'll burn down this village.

78
00:10:14.719 --> 00:10:18.193
l'll go with you.
Don't hurt anyone.

79
00:10:33.608 --> 00:10:36.211
They were looking for someone old
and they were looking for someone

80
00:10:36.342 --> 00:10:38.046
with the same markings the boy had.

81
00:10:38.179 --> 00:10:41.450
They dragged Mom away
the same way when we were babies.

82
00:10:41.581 --> 00:10:44.921
She wouldn't have watched us being
taken away. She would have fought.

83
00:10:45.051 --> 00:10:48.592
We found that boy. He's our
responsibility. We should fight.

84
00:10:49.789 --> 00:10:52.495
What would you do
if they tried to take me away?

85
00:10:52.627 --> 00:10:54.127
l'd kill them all.

86
00:10:55.596 --> 00:10:58.234
- Why?
- Because you're my sister.

87
00:10:58.897 --> 00:11:01.571
Because Dad told me
to protect you with my life.

88
00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:08.680
Because l'm your responsibility.
And this boy is our responsibility.

89
00:11:12.211 --> 00:11:16.220
What do you want us to do, Katara?
How are we supposed to save him?

90
00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:18.756
They're on a ship.
We'd need a miracle to catch them.

91
00:11:18.888 --> 00:11:21.891
l know you think everything's
going to work out, but l don't.

92
00:11:37.337 --> 00:11:39.843
His bison creature thing floats.

93
00:12:00.627 --> 00:12:01.763
What do you want with me?

94
00:12:03.199 --> 00:12:06.537
My nephew wants me to perform
a little test on you.

95
00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:12.010
- What kind of test?
- l assure you, it won't hurt.

96
00:12:12.142 --> 00:12:15.646
l've performed it hundreds of times.
It only takes a few moments.

97
00:12:15.776 --> 00:12:17.311
And then you're free to go.

98
00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.254
Would you mind if l put a few things
in front of you at the table?

99
00:12:22.886 --> 00:12:24.888
lt will only take a moment.

100
00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:27.455
That's all you want?

101
00:12:27.589 --> 00:12:30.794
My name is Iroh,
and you have my word.

102
00:12:32.594 --> 00:12:34.533
Grandma, l know
you're gonna try to stop us,

103
00:12:34.664 --> 00:12:37.469
- but this is iust something l need...
- Sit down.

104
00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:43.175
l knew from the first time
we discovered you were a Bender,

105
00:12:43.304 --> 00:12:46.244
that one day,
l would realize your destiny.

106
00:12:47.143 --> 00:12:51.920
There hasn't been a Waterbender
in the Southern Water Tribe

107
00:12:52.048 --> 00:12:54.950
since my friend Hama was taken away.

108
00:12:56.585 --> 00:13:00.259
Today, l found out that destiny.

109
00:13:01.292 --> 00:13:02.926
Did you see that boy's tattoos?

110
00:13:03.858 --> 00:13:07.264
Tattoos like that haven't
been seen in over a century.

111
00:13:08.264 --> 00:13:11.870
l believe they are Airbending tattoos.

112
00:13:12.234 --> 00:13:14.104
How can that be?

113
00:13:14.236 --> 00:13:19.281
l believe that little boy
might be the Avatar.

114
00:13:22.111 --> 00:13:27.654
Once, a long time ago,
the Spirit World kept balance over us.

115
00:13:27.784 --> 00:13:29.822
What is the Spirit World, Grandma?

116
00:13:29.953 --> 00:13:32.993
lt's not a place made up
of things you can touch.

117
00:13:33.124 --> 00:13:35.861
But it exists, nonetheless.

118
00:13:37.094 --> 00:13:41.969
lt is filled with the most amazing forms
of dazzling creatures...

119
00:13:42.465 --> 00:13:48.074
...that exist in the most
exotic valleys, mountains and forests.

120
00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:52.746
Each of these creatures is a Spirit.

121
00:13:52.877 --> 00:13:55.414
They've watched over us
since the beginning.

122
00:13:55.546 --> 00:14:00.220
They have guided us. And only
the Avatar can go speak to them.

123
00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.085
Aren't there Spirits here?

124
00:14:02.318 --> 00:14:06.161
Yes, there are some Spirits
that live hidden among us,

125
00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:09.562
sure they're watching us
with great sadness...

126
00:14:11.161 --> 00:14:15.737
The Fire Nation doesn't wish
to live by the Spirits.

127
00:14:15.867 --> 00:14:19.340
That's why they're so frightened
by the existence of the Avatar.

128
00:14:19.837 --> 00:14:23.311
- What can he do?
- With his mastery of the four elements,

129
00:14:23.441 --> 00:14:27.349
he will begin to change hearts.

130
00:14:28.345 --> 00:14:32.687
And it is in the heart
that all wars are won.

131
00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:38.525
Now, go help this boy.

132
00:14:39.925 --> 00:14:41.592
He will need you two.

133
00:14:43.192 --> 00:14:45.865
And we all need him.

134
00:15:48.463 --> 00:15:51.333
You are my prisoner...

135
00:15:52.431 --> 00:15:54.101
...Airbender.

136
00:15:56.369 --> 00:15:57.939
l'm taking you back to the Fire Nation.

137
00:15:58.339 --> 00:16:00.809
- You said...
- l apologize.

138
00:16:00.941 --> 00:16:02.876
l should have explained further.

139
00:16:03.007 --> 00:16:07.952
lf you failed the test, as all others
did, you were free to leave.

140
00:16:08.081 --> 00:16:13.057
But, as it turns out, you are
the only one in the entire world

141
00:16:13.187 --> 00:16:15.089
who could pass this test.

142
00:16:16.455 --> 00:16:18.693
lt is truly an honor
to be in your presence.

143
00:16:20.561 --> 00:16:23.299
Don't even try to escape.
This is a warship!

144
00:16:28.402 --> 00:16:29.803
Stop! There's no way you can...

145
00:17:08.911 --> 00:17:11.179
Don't move! You have nowhere to run!

146
00:17:11.478 --> 00:17:12.479
Halt!

147
00:17:13.077 --> 00:17:14.582
Don't let him escape!

148
00:17:15.016 --> 00:17:16.017
Get him!

149
00:17:38.439 --> 00:17:40.209
Thanks for bringing Appa to me.

150
00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:43.379
The Fire Nation is up to something.
l have to go back now.

151
00:17:43.511 --> 00:17:46.617
- We'll come with you.
- l can take you back to the village.

152
00:17:48.718 --> 00:17:49.885
We're going with you.

153
00:17:52.985 --> 00:17:55.123
You found the Avatar.

154
00:17:56.959 --> 00:18:00.299
For a moment, l had my honor back.

155
00:18:01.798 --> 00:18:07.140
Your destinies are tied, Zuko.
That, you can be sure of.

156
00:18:13.075 --> 00:18:17.080
Aang flew us to his home. He told us
how he leff there in a storm on Appa,

157
00:18:17.311 --> 00:18:20.151
and got forced into the ocean
where they almost drowned.

158
00:18:20.281 --> 00:18:23.053
Aang Airbended a sphere around them,
and ice formed.

159
00:18:23.185 --> 00:18:25.657
And he couldn"t remember
anything after that.

160
00:18:25.823 --> 00:18:29.160
Hey, Chinto! Monae! l'm back!

161
00:18:29.492 --> 00:18:32.598
Hey, guys! l want you to meet someone!

162
00:18:33.494 --> 00:18:35.166
This is where you live?

163
00:18:35.297 --> 00:18:37.502
They must be playing some trick
or something.

164
00:18:37.632 --> 00:18:40.505
Monk Gyatso is gonna try and iump out
and scare me at any moment.

165
00:18:40.971 --> 00:18:42.908
He's the teacher responsible for me.

166
00:18:45.474 --> 00:18:47.110
He's kind of like my father.

167
00:18:48.011 --> 00:18:51.182
- Is it OK if you tell me your name?
- The monks named me Aang.

168
00:18:53.184 --> 00:18:55.854
OK, guys! Enough!

169
00:18:58.185 --> 00:19:01.025
Spider-rat!
They're poisonous! Get behind me.

170
00:19:02.191 --> 00:19:04.864
He's a flying lemur-bat.
We keep them as pets.

171
00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:06.700
Weren't they extinct a long time ago?

172
00:19:07.698 --> 00:19:11.135
Extinct? No, there must be thousands
of them on this mountain.

173
00:19:13.934 --> 00:19:15.873
Your friends were monks?

174
00:19:16.006 --> 00:19:18.845
l know where they are right now.
They're at the prayer field!

175
00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:26.218
Aang, wait! l have to talk to you!

176
00:19:36.895 --> 00:19:38.227
Aang...

177
00:19:39.229 --> 00:19:44.073
...l think you were in that ice
for almost a hundred years.

178
00:19:46.404 --> 00:19:51.378
- The Firebenders started a war.
- l left a few days ago.

179
00:19:52.209 --> 00:19:57.086
Aang, the Fire Nation knew the Avatar
would be born into the Air Nomads...

180
00:19:58.583 --> 00:20:00.921
...so they exterminated
all the Air Nomads.

181
00:20:11.429 --> 00:20:12.429
You're lying!

182
00:20:12.931 --> 00:20:14.600
You're lying!

183
00:20:26.011 --> 00:20:28.013
This is Monk Gyatso's.

184
00:20:28.947 --> 00:20:30.617
l made it for him.

185
00:20:43.628 --> 00:20:47.035
No!

186
00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:06.254
Katara! Stay away from him!

187
00:21:10.322 --> 00:21:11.321
Katara!

188
00:21:11.588 --> 00:21:13.259
Stay away from him!

189
00:21:17.929 --> 00:21:19.534
Your friends were monks?

190
00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:50.765
The Avatar?

191
00:21:52.198 --> 00:21:55.069
Where have you been?

192
00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.537
Aang!

193
00:21:56.869 --> 00:21:59.507
You can"t bring Monk Gyatso back,

194
00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:03.314
but Sokka and l can be with you
as long as you need!

195
00:22:03.644 --> 00:22:07.450
Don"t give up! We can do this together!

196
00:22:08.547 --> 00:22:10.051
Aang!

197
00:22:46.018 --> 00:22:47.755
The banished prince.

198
00:22:50.591 --> 00:22:52.261
Let's offer him lunch.

199
00:22:55.397 --> 00:22:59.002
l wanted to thank
the great General Iroh

200
00:22:59.132 --> 00:23:02.404
and young Prince Zuko
for dining with us.

201
00:23:05.074 --> 00:23:09.649
As you know, the Fire Lord
has banished his son, the Prince,

202
00:23:09.778 --> 00:23:12.949
and renounced his love of him, and will
not let him return to the throne

203
00:23:13.080 --> 00:23:14.784
unless he finds the Avatar.

204
00:23:15.849 --> 00:23:19.122
The Fire Lord believes his son
is too soft

205
00:23:19.254 --> 00:23:22.158
and by doing this,
he will become strong

206
00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:25.297
and become a worthy heir
to the throne.

207
00:23:26.627 --> 00:23:29.164
l commend the Fire Lord's discipline.

208
00:23:29.296 --> 00:23:33.306
For example, it seems
l need to remind Prince Zuko

209
00:23:33.436 --> 00:23:37.812
that, during his banishment,
he is an enemy of the Fire Nation

210
00:23:37.939 --> 00:23:41.077
and is not allowed
to wear the Fire Nation uniform.

211
00:23:42.642 --> 00:23:45.048
But we will let him wear it today,

212
00:23:45.180 --> 00:23:47.419
like a child wearing a costume.

213
00:23:55.489 --> 00:24:00.333
One day, my father will take me back
and you will bow before me.

214
00:25:13.235 --> 00:25:14.303
You OK?

215
00:25:15.905 --> 00:25:17.440
l'll be fine.

216
00:25:17.572 --> 00:25:21.415
You know, my grandma thinks
because you're an Airbender,

217
00:25:21.546 --> 00:25:22.917
that you could be the Avatar.

218
00:25:25.782 --> 00:25:27.919
How much does
the Fire Nation control?

219
00:25:29.086 --> 00:25:32.057
A lot of villages in the Earth Kingdom,
like around here.

220
00:25:32.186 --> 00:25:35.461
They haven't been able to conquer
big cities, like Ba Sing Se,

221
00:25:35.593 --> 00:25:37.762
but they're making plans, l'm sure.

222
00:25:39.096 --> 00:25:40.429
So...

223
00:25:41.264 --> 00:25:43.534
...are you the Avatar, Aang?

224
00:25:50.275 --> 00:25:51.610
What is this?

225
00:25:52.878 --> 00:25:54.011
Stay hidden.

226
00:26:01.119 --> 00:26:03.425
- That child is being arrested.
- For what?

227
00:26:03.555 --> 00:26:07.896
He was bending tiny stones at us
from behind a tree. It really hurt.

228
00:26:08.023 --> 00:26:09.259
He can bend earth?

229
00:26:10.127 --> 00:26:12.732
Earthbending is forbidden
in this village.

230
00:26:13.465 --> 00:26:17.305
Leave him alone.
You're not taking him anywhere.

231
00:26:17.835 --> 00:26:21.208
No one is taking anybody away!

232
00:26:24.709 --> 00:26:25.778
She's a bender!

233
00:26:31.649 --> 00:26:32.986
Katara!

234
00:26:55.841 --> 00:26:57.010
Move.

235
00:26:57.843 --> 00:26:59.012
You, too.

236
00:26:59.146 --> 00:27:00.146
Dad!

237
00:27:04.181 --> 00:27:06.955
- This is my father.
- Hello.

238
00:27:07.086 --> 00:27:10.859
That's the Fire Nation's plan,
suppress all other bending.

239
00:27:13.026 --> 00:27:15.361
How did this happen to your village?

240
00:27:16.862 --> 00:27:21.205
Fire Nation sent soldiers.
We fought them and defeated them.

241
00:27:22.369 --> 00:27:27.245
Then they sent their machines,
huge machines made of metal.

242
00:27:27.374 --> 00:27:29.374
There was nothing we could do.

243
00:27:30.941 --> 00:27:33.982
Those who could not bend were
allowed to live in peace,

244
00:27:34.113 --> 00:27:35.715
if we were imprisoned.

245
00:27:47.894 --> 00:27:49.062
Earthbenders!

246
00:27:52.566 --> 00:27:57.908
Why are you acting this way?
You are powerful and amazing people!

247
00:27:58.036 --> 00:28:02.414
You don't need to live like this!
There is earth right beneath your feet.

248
00:28:04.046 --> 00:28:07.251
The ground is an extension
of who you are!

249
00:28:10.482 --> 00:28:12.420
lf the Avatar had returned...

250
00:28:14.253 --> 00:28:15.789
...would that mean anything to you?

251
00:28:15.923 --> 00:28:20.867
The Avatar is dead.
If he was here, he would protect us.

252
00:28:22.662 --> 00:28:24.099
My name is Aang...

253
00:28:25.698 --> 00:28:27.102
...and l am the Avatar.

254
00:28:28.936 --> 00:28:31.774
l ran away, but l'm back now.

255
00:28:35.274 --> 00:28:37.780
lt's time for you to stop doing this!

256
00:28:38.444 --> 00:28:43.454
The Avatar would have to be an
Airbender. Are you an Airbender, boy?

257
00:28:46.287 --> 00:28:47.957
Leave him alone!

258
00:28:54.293 --> 00:28:56.164
How is he doing that?

259
00:28:56.297 --> 00:28:58.367
l don't want to hurt anyone.

260
00:28:58.500 --> 00:29:02.540
All Airbenders should be dead.
Kill him! Firebenders, positions!

261
00:29:06.305 --> 00:29:09.980
OK! Everybody can help us now!

262
00:29:33.101 --> 00:29:35.171
Don't be afraid!

263
00:30:12.873 --> 00:30:14.377
Just leave them!

264
00:30:15.377 --> 00:30:16.814
Fall back!

265
00:30:17.815 --> 00:30:19.884
Go! He's an Airbender!

266
00:30:39.734 --> 00:30:44.011
They took away any tools
related to bending.

267
00:30:57.655 --> 00:31:01.529
The Fire Nation took this scroll
from a member of your Water Tribe.

268
00:31:03.260 --> 00:31:05.263
A Waterbending scroll.

269
00:31:09.932 --> 00:31:13.674
This is rare.
My mom told me about these.

270
00:31:15.540 --> 00:31:19.013
This was you when
you were born an Earthbender,

271
00:31:19.143 --> 00:31:21.613
two lifetimes ago.

272
00:31:21.744 --> 00:31:23.148
You came to our village.

273
00:31:24.079 --> 00:31:28.390
Avatar Kyoshi loved games.

274
00:31:28.520 --> 00:31:31.925
l do, too.
l mean, l still do.

275
00:31:32.923 --> 00:31:35.729
A lot of the villages in this part
of the Earth Kingdom are occupied

276
00:31:35.861 --> 00:31:37.964
by the Fire Nation,
like this village was.

277
00:31:38.563 --> 00:31:42.136
They prey on the weakest towns
and villages.

278
00:31:42.266 --> 00:31:44.234
We should go visit
some of these towns, Aang.

279
00:31:44.366 --> 00:31:46.939
- l need to tell you something.
- What is it, Aang?

280
00:31:48.472 --> 00:31:51.947
l ran away before they trained me
to be the Avatar.

281
00:31:52.077 --> 00:31:54.079
l don't know how
to bend the other elements.

282
00:31:55.578 --> 00:31:57.214
Why did you run away?

283
00:31:57.714 --> 00:32:00.987
The day they told me l was the Avatar,
they said l could never

284
00:32:01.118 --> 00:32:04.058
have a normal life,
that l could never have a family.

285
00:32:04.488 --> 00:32:07.595
They said it cannot work with
the responsibilities of the Avatar.

286
00:32:07.726 --> 00:32:10.930
- Why can't the Avatar have a family?
- l asked that!

287
00:32:11.062 --> 00:32:14.436
They said that's the sacrifice
the Avatar always has to make.

288
00:32:14.565 --> 00:32:18.106
OK. So, what if we found you teachers.
Teachers to teach you bending?

289
00:32:18.236 --> 00:32:20.105
Which element would you
have to learn first?

290
00:32:20.237 --> 00:32:23.508
Water. Water comes
after Air in the cycle.

291
00:32:23.640 --> 00:32:26.214
Air, Water, Earth, Fire.

292
00:32:26.346 --> 00:32:29.417
But there are really powerful benders
in the Northern Water Tribe.

293
00:32:29.647 --> 00:32:31.352
My dad told me about it before he left.

294
00:32:31.484 --> 00:32:33.855
lt's led by a princess because
her father died.

295
00:32:33.987 --> 00:32:37.057
There are teachers there, but all
the way on the other side of the world.

296
00:32:37.188 --> 00:32:39.860
- We can get there on Appa.
- That's what l was thinking.

297
00:32:39.992 --> 00:32:42.097
And maybe we can stop
in the villages on the way,

298
00:32:42.227 --> 00:32:44.765
start a change in The War
in these small villages.

299
00:32:45.598 --> 00:32:48.137
- Should we try it?
- Yes, we should.

300
00:33:42.390 --> 00:33:45.459
The scroll we had
was proving to be helpful.

301
00:33:45.590 --> 00:33:49.266
Aang was practicing,
but for some reason,

302
00:33:49.395 --> 00:33:51.832
he was having trouble
with Waterbending.

303
00:33:59.071 --> 00:34:02.213
We moved from town to town
in the Earth Kingdom.

304
00:34:02.342 --> 00:34:03.878
We tried to stay out of sight,

305
00:34:04.011 --> 00:34:08.621
but Sokka became concerned
we were being followed.

306
00:34:41.214 --> 00:34:43.586
Sire, l have good news.

307
00:34:43.717 --> 00:34:46.091
As you know, l conducted a raid
on the Great Library,

308
00:34:46.222 --> 00:34:48.458
- which most said didn't exist.
- Get on with it.

309
00:34:48.657 --> 00:34:53.663
l found scrolls in the library.
We are deciphering them.

310
00:34:53.793 --> 00:34:55.798
But l believe they may
contain information

311
00:34:55.930 --> 00:34:59.170
as to where the Ocean and Moon
Spirits live in this world.

312
00:34:59.300 --> 00:35:01.005
With this information,

313
00:35:01.139 --> 00:35:03.675
we could bring down
the Northern Water Tribe city,

314
00:35:03.806 --> 00:35:07.511
we could show the world
the true strength of fire.

315
00:35:07.641 --> 00:35:09.310
l am pleased.

316
00:35:09.978 --> 00:35:14.720
Well, Commander Zhao,
are the rumors true or not?

317
00:35:14.849 --> 00:35:18.923
Our spies have discovered someone
claiming to be the Avatar.

318
00:35:20.156 --> 00:35:22.092
They describe him as just a boy.

319
00:35:23.591 --> 00:35:25.663
We should set a trap for this person.

320
00:35:25.794 --> 00:35:28.398
We have many Earth Kingdom people
under our control.

321
00:35:28.530 --> 00:35:31.736
l can leave soldiers
hidden in certain locations.

322
00:35:31.866 --> 00:35:36.643
- And my son?
- He had his chance. He missed it.

323
00:35:37.939 --> 00:35:39.943
Let's hope, for your sake,

324
00:35:40.075 --> 00:35:44.950
my son doesn't find this person first
and he turns out to be the Avatar.

325
00:35:45.980 --> 00:35:49.987
He would return as a hero and,
for all purposes, be your superior.

326
00:35:51.753 --> 00:35:55.829
Well, l suppose it's a race, then.

327
00:36:16.312 --> 00:36:17.982
We're close, Uncle.

328
00:36:18.615 --> 00:36:21.489
They've been moving
farther and farther north.

329
00:36:23.285 --> 00:36:24.654
We're catching them.

330
00:36:29.357 --> 00:36:31.830
There are a lot of pretty girls
in this town, Zuko.

331
00:36:32.831 --> 00:36:34.934
You could fall in love here.

332
00:36:35.067 --> 00:36:39.506
We could settle down here,
and you could have a blessed life.

333
00:36:42.304 --> 00:36:44.674
We don't have to continue this, Zuko.

334
00:36:46.843 --> 00:36:49.348
l'll show you why we must, Uncle.

335
00:36:51.782 --> 00:36:55.921
Hey. Hey. Little one, come here.

336
00:37:01.026 --> 00:37:03.362
You look like a very smart boy.

337
00:37:05.464 --> 00:37:09.668
Tell me what you know about the
Prince, the Fire Lord's son.

338
00:37:09.799 --> 00:37:14.677
- He did something wrong.
- He spoke out of turn to a general,

339
00:37:14.807 --> 00:37:16.809
in defense of some of his friends

340
00:37:16.943 --> 00:37:20.881
who were going to be sacrificed
in a battle.

341
00:37:21.012 --> 00:37:25.554
Then Prince Zuko
was sentenced to an Agni Kai duel,

342
00:37:25.683 --> 00:37:27.153
but when he showed up,

343
00:37:27.286 --> 00:37:31.161
- it was his father he was to fight.
- That's right.

344
00:37:31.389 --> 00:37:33.925
He would not fight his father.

345
00:37:34.057 --> 00:37:38.099
Then his father mocked him and said,

346
00:37:38.229 --> 00:37:40.902
''l should bring your sister
up here to beat you.''

347
00:37:42.267 --> 00:37:44.972
Then the father burnt his son...

348
00:37:46.069 --> 00:37:47.572
...to teach him a lesson.

349
00:37:58.085 --> 00:37:59.920
We'll catch him soon, Uncle.

350
00:38:01.018 --> 00:38:03.589
Then we can think
about the pretty girls.

351
00:38:14.097 --> 00:38:15.402
Aang...

352
00:38:15.534 --> 00:38:17.771
Try to keep your wrist bent,
like it's showing.

353
00:38:21.606 --> 00:38:25.647
What's wrong?
You've really been distracted today.

354
00:38:25.777 --> 00:38:29.650
l saw Sokka's maps.
We're near the Northern Air Temple.

355
00:38:29.780 --> 00:38:33.556
Do you think it would be OK
if l just visited there and came back?

356
00:38:33.687 --> 00:38:36.456
- l'd be back in less than a day.
- Why?

357
00:38:36.587 --> 00:38:39.461
He had a vision
at the Southern Air Temple prayer field.

358
00:38:39.589 --> 00:38:42.595
He talked to a Dragon Spirit
who he thinks can help us.

359
00:38:42.728 --> 00:38:45.266
He thinks if he goes
to another spiritual place,

360
00:38:45.397 --> 00:38:47.136
he can get back to the Spirit World.

361
00:38:47.268 --> 00:38:51.040
l don't think that's a good idea.
We started a rebellion.

362
00:38:51.805 --> 00:38:53.639
Try to talk him out of it.

363
00:39:46.461 --> 00:39:48.195
l can't do this.

364
00:39:48.828 --> 00:39:49.964
l need help.

365
00:40:01.207 --> 00:40:04.112
- l guess your talk didn't work.
- He'll be back in a day.

366
00:40:04.678 --> 00:40:08.317
The Fire Nation is following us. If we
make a wrong move, they'll catch him.

367
00:40:47.022 --> 00:40:48.491
Who are you?

368
00:40:51.426 --> 00:40:53.765
Why, it cannot be!

369
00:40:54.594 --> 00:40:57.934
l've heard stories. Are you...?

370
00:40:58.732 --> 00:41:00.336
My name is Aang.

371
00:41:00.936 --> 00:41:04.943
l cannot believe
l've lived to see your return.

372
00:41:05.841 --> 00:41:09.949
l'm an Earth villager,
but l visit these temple remains often.

373
00:41:10.079 --> 00:41:14.186
The Fire Nation destroyed this temple.
They have ruined everything.

374
00:41:14.316 --> 00:41:17.489
No, no, no, not everything.

375
00:41:17.618 --> 00:41:21.492
You know, there's
a hidden chamber of statues

376
00:41:21.622 --> 00:41:24.394
l think you, of all people, should see.

377
00:41:24.992 --> 00:41:27.631
These are all the Avatars.

378
00:41:28.632 --> 00:41:32.639
These are the reincarnations
of you over the years.

379
00:41:35.536 --> 00:41:39.311
The Avatar Roku was your last life.

380
00:41:42.211 --> 00:41:46.820
Now, how did the Airbenders know
you were the Avatar, little one?

381
00:41:48.851 --> 00:41:50.653
They gave me a test.

382
00:41:51.584 --> 00:41:55.495
They put 1,000 toys in front of me
and asked me to choose four.

383
00:41:56.326 --> 00:42:00.233
They said l chose the same four obiects
that belonged to the previous Avatars.

384
00:42:03.433 --> 00:42:05.770
That's when they told me
l could have no family.

385
00:42:07.636 --> 00:42:10.909
Told me l had a responsibility
to the Four Nations.

386
00:42:15.478 --> 00:42:18.248
There's a ceremony
when everyone bows to me.

387
00:42:20.481 --> 00:42:22.854
That's when l accept my role
as the Avatar.

388
00:42:25.021 --> 00:42:26.792
But when everyone bowed...

389
00:42:30.427 --> 00:42:32.429
...l didn't bow back.

390
00:42:32.860 --> 00:42:35.199
You seem like a nice young man.

391
00:42:36.466 --> 00:42:42.411
You really do.
You will forgive me, won't you?

392
00:42:43.807 --> 00:42:46.546
- For what?
- For luring you down here.

393
00:42:49.946 --> 00:42:54.055
l have lived in poverty
because of your absence, Avatar.

394
00:42:54.185 --> 00:42:57.623
So you will understand
my actions today.

395
00:43:18.742 --> 00:43:23.082
l have lived in poverty
because of your absence, Avatar.

396
00:43:28.919 --> 00:43:33.361
l have seen a vision
of the moon turning red.

397
00:43:34.160 --> 00:43:39.300
The Fire Nation has stolen knowledge
of us from the Great Library.

398
00:43:39.429 --> 00:43:42.738
They are planning
to misuse this knowledge.

399
00:43:42.867 --> 00:43:44.204
l will stop them.

400
00:43:44.337 --> 00:43:48.411
You must go
to the Northern Water Tribe.

401
00:43:48.541 --> 00:43:52.144
lf they take that city,
more will suffer and die,

402
00:43:52.274 --> 00:43:54.513
as your Airbenders have.

403
00:43:55.079 --> 00:43:57.484
You must go now!

404
00:43:57.617 --> 00:43:58.885
Will l stop them?

405
00:43:59.017 --> 00:44:00.354
Wake up, young man!

406
00:44:03.288 --> 00:44:07.361
My name is Commander Zhao.
l set this trap for you.

407
00:44:09.562 --> 00:44:12.465
Don't worry, l'm not gonna kill you.

408
00:44:13.667 --> 00:44:18.174
Besides, you'd just be reborn again,

409
00:44:18.303 --> 00:44:20.473
and then the search would continue.

410
00:44:23.942 --> 00:44:27.649
So where have you been all this time?

411
00:44:29.313 --> 00:44:31.652
And how is it that you're still a boy?

412
00:44:34.884 --> 00:44:37.223
l understand that when you freed
that handful of towns,

413
00:44:37.355 --> 00:44:39.661
you were very impressive, but...

414
00:44:41.362 --> 00:44:44.999
...you only used Airbending
against my soldiers.

415
00:44:46.997 --> 00:44:49.001
Now, why is that?

416
00:45:01.847 --> 00:45:04.319
The Fire Lord and l have a plan

417
00:45:04.450 --> 00:45:08.992
to ensure our reign
and the downfall of our enemies.

418
00:45:09.123 --> 00:45:12.194
l am sending a personal message
to the Fire Lord,

419
00:45:12.425 --> 00:45:15.230
informing him
that the once feared Avatar

420
00:45:15.361 --> 00:45:19.570
is our prisoner
and no threat to our might.

421
00:45:56.370 --> 00:45:57.673
Who are you?

422
00:46:00.542 --> 00:46:01.645
Wait! Don't!

423
00:46:02.745 --> 00:46:04.078
Stop!

424
00:46:31.438 --> 00:46:32.774
Fools.

425
00:46:34.374 --> 00:46:38.049
Close the inner gates!
The Avatar has escaped!

426
00:46:46.790 --> 00:46:48.558
Lock down the gate!

427
00:46:49.791 --> 00:46:52.129
Lock down all the gates!

428
00:47:06.676 --> 00:47:09.081
To the main post!

429
00:47:09.747 --> 00:47:10.913
This was their practice area.

430
00:47:11.045 --> 00:47:13.650
Go again!

431
00:49:15.905 --> 00:49:18.210
Do not kill the Avatar!

432
00:49:18.341 --> 00:49:20.045
He will just be reborn again!

433
00:49:21.680 --> 00:49:23.283
Why are you doing this? Who are you?

434
00:49:34.827 --> 00:49:35.894
Open the gates.

435
00:49:37.729 --> 00:49:39.230
Let them out!

436
00:49:55.713 --> 00:49:59.089
- Is it some kind of Spirit, Commander?
- Not at all.

437
00:50:00.753 --> 00:50:02.087
Do it.

438
00:50:52.672 --> 00:50:53.975
What is this?

439
00:51:52.033 --> 00:51:55.037
And how did he escape?

440
00:51:57.037 --> 00:52:01.548
l fear that your son
is not only incompetent,

441
00:52:01.677 --> 00:52:03.545
but also a traitor.

442
00:52:04.211 --> 00:52:06.447
Of course, l cannot prove this, sire.

443
00:52:10.215 --> 00:52:11.887
You think...

444
00:52:12.555 --> 00:52:15.727
...my son is this person

445
00:52:15.858 --> 00:52:19.130
the soldiers are calling
the Blue Spirit.

446
00:52:22.230 --> 00:52:23.698
Yes.

447
00:52:29.206 --> 00:52:32.244
Zhao's men were searching the coast,
Iooking for you.

448
00:52:33.239 --> 00:52:35.411
They also searched the ship.

449
00:52:36.710 --> 00:52:39.583
l told them you went
on vacation with a girl.

450
00:52:43.252 --> 00:52:45.388
Where were you the past four days?

451
00:52:47.920 --> 00:52:49.257
Nowhere.

452
00:52:51.025 --> 00:52:52.828
We have to keep moving.

453
00:52:54.130 --> 00:52:56.169
The Avatar is traveling again.

454
00:52:57.267 --> 00:52:59.103
Take rest first.

455
00:52:59.933 --> 00:53:02.506
lt looks like you
went through a great deal.

456
00:53:03.336 --> 00:53:08.115
When you wake, we'll have tea together
before we start the engines.

457
00:53:17.452 --> 00:53:19.623
Do not harm my son.

458
00:53:20.590 --> 00:53:23.127
Leave him to his isolation.

459
00:53:23.792 --> 00:53:27.833
You have my word, sire.
l will not harm him.

460
00:53:53.822 --> 00:53:55.492
Zuko!

461
00:54:07.769 --> 00:54:09.673
And what of the Avatar ?

462
00:54:10.006 --> 00:54:12.811
We assume he has
rejoined with his supporters.

463
00:54:22.919 --> 00:54:25.357
lt has been confirmed
that he's traveling north.

464
00:54:25.623 --> 00:54:29.263
lt is my strong belief that he is
traveling to the Northern Water Tribe.

465
00:54:30.195 --> 00:54:34.869
l believe the child Avatar has only
knowledge of his birth element, Air.

466
00:54:35.799 --> 00:54:39.939
l believe he is tying to learn
in the discipline of water.

467
00:54:40.070 --> 00:54:43.311
He's gone to seek out someone
in the Northern Water Tribe,

468
00:54:43.442 --> 00:54:48.349
where they have lived beyond our reach
and openly practice Waterbending.

469
00:55:33.958 --> 00:55:37.032
We arrived at the Northern Water Tribe.

470
00:55:37.163 --> 00:55:39.934
We presented ourselves
to the royal court.

471
00:55:43.001 --> 00:55:46.608
My brother and the princess
became friends right away.

472
00:56:01.119 --> 00:56:04.259
Aang showed them he
was the last Airbender,

473
00:56:04.391 --> 00:56:07.130
and was accepted
to train with the master.

474
00:56:23.141 --> 00:56:26.415
The city knew our arrival
would bring great danger.

475
00:56:26.546 --> 00:56:30.655
And they prepared for war they knew
would come in the ensuing weeks.

476
00:56:34.654 --> 00:56:37.825
The city was designed
to withstand any assault.

477
00:56:38.157 --> 00:56:41.597
lf we keep them to the courtyard
and the marketplace till night falls,

478
00:56:41.829 --> 00:56:44.902
where we have the advantage,
we will succeed.

479
00:56:45.565 --> 00:56:47.335
lf we let too many of them
into the city,

480
00:56:47.469 --> 00:56:49.839
their sheer numbers
could overwhelm us.

481
00:56:50.503 --> 00:56:54.275
As many fires in this city should be put
out as possible when the alarm sounds.

482
00:56:54.406 --> 00:56:57.949
We want to minimize
their bender sources.

483
00:56:59.346 --> 00:57:02.249
l must assign a guard
to be with you at all times, Princess.

484
00:57:02.714 --> 00:57:06.188
Your presence is our inspiration.

485
00:57:06.319 --> 00:57:09.292
l'll do it. That's me.
l'll be her guard.

486
00:57:09.423 --> 00:57:10.995
Nothing will happen to her.

487
00:57:13.294 --> 00:57:15.763
l had a feeling you might volunteer.

488
00:57:18.729 --> 00:57:21.603
l've heard no word of my son
for quite some time.

489
00:57:21.734 --> 00:57:25.542
- Do you know where he is?
- l've not heard of anything, sire.

490
00:57:25.673 --> 00:57:28.579
l'm sure word of him
will come to us soon.

491
00:57:28.710 --> 00:57:31.480
The Northern Water Tribe benders
are given their strength

492
00:57:31.611 --> 00:57:35.386
by the Moon and Ocean Spirits.
They will be difficult to defeat.

493
00:57:35.649 --> 00:57:39.824
Now, if for some reason
the Spirits were not involved,

494
00:57:39.954 --> 00:57:41.725
that would be different.

495
00:57:43.656 --> 00:57:46.562
What have you learned
from the stolen scrolls?

496
00:57:47.227 --> 00:57:51.470
We have deciphered the location
of the Moon and Ocean Spirits.

497
00:57:54.235 --> 00:57:59.242
lt is our destiny to have found
this information, Zhao.

498
00:58:02.676 --> 00:58:05.115
Eliminate the Spirits,

499
00:58:05.247 --> 00:58:09.756
take the city and we will have
thwarted the Avatar in the process.

500
00:58:22.198 --> 00:58:23.764
Water is what?

501
00:58:23.896 --> 00:58:26.502
The flowing element.
The element of change.

502
00:58:27.770 --> 00:58:30.941
To master water,
you must release your emotions,

503
00:58:31.072 --> 00:58:33.309
wherever they may lead you.

504
00:58:33.442 --> 00:58:36.112
Water teaches us acceptance.

505
00:58:37.110 --> 00:58:39.783
Let your emotions flow like water.

506
00:58:41.383 --> 00:58:45.693
Aang, would you like to spar?
You haven't sparred in a few days.

507
00:59:18.186 --> 00:59:19.822
Now, use offense, Aang!

508
01:00:13.709 --> 01:00:17.484
General Iroh, l'm glad you could
accept my invitation to join us

509
01:00:17.615 --> 01:00:21.890
- on this historic event.
- Your invitation was most gracious.

510
01:00:22.020 --> 01:00:25.392
You are a gifted strategist.
No one can argue that.

511
01:00:25.789 --> 01:00:30.732
Your failure in the Hundred Day Siege
of Ba Sing Se won't be held against you.

512
01:00:31.728 --> 01:00:34.735
Your son died in that siege, didn't he?

513
01:00:36.636 --> 01:00:37.902
Yes, he did.

514
01:00:39.503 --> 01:00:42.542
Again, l offer my condolences
on your nephew burning to death

515
01:00:42.673 --> 01:00:44.577
in that terrible accident.

516
01:00:46.912 --> 01:00:48.046
Thank you.

517
01:00:56.087 --> 01:00:58.559
l've loved spending
these weeks with you, Sokka.

518
01:00:58.691 --> 01:01:00.195
Me, too.

519
01:01:04.761 --> 01:01:07.197
Should we see what the ocean
is doing today?

520
01:01:13.937 --> 01:01:15.910
When there is some safety for all of us,

521
01:01:16.042 --> 01:01:18.879
l will come visit our sister city
in the Southern Water Tribe

522
01:01:19.009 --> 01:01:21.246
and spend some time in your home.

523
01:01:21.779 --> 01:01:23.280
That would be great.

524
01:01:25.450 --> 01:01:27.222
But l warn you...

525
01:01:28.221 --> 01:01:31.960
...my grandmother will ask you
a lot of questions.

526
01:01:39.031 --> 01:01:40.635
What might she ask me?

527
01:01:42.469 --> 01:01:47.476
She'll say, ''Why is your hair white,
young lady? You look very odd.''

528
01:01:48.473 --> 01:01:52.682
l would say to your grandmother, my
hair is white because when l was born

529
01:01:52.811 --> 01:01:54.850
l was not awake.

530
01:01:54.982 --> 01:01:58.819
My mother and father could not get me
to make a sound or move.

531
01:01:59.484 --> 01:02:01.520
So they prayed for days
to the Moon Spirit

532
01:02:01.652 --> 01:02:04.493
and dipped me into the sacred waters.

533
01:02:06.660 --> 01:02:11.668
My parents said that my hair turned
white then and life poured into me.

534
01:02:13.498 --> 01:02:14.666
Wow.

535
01:02:16.503 --> 01:02:18.172
You didn't tell me that.

536
01:02:19.338 --> 01:02:21.340
You didn't ask me.

537
01:02:21.907 --> 01:02:23.679
Only your grandmother did.

538
01:02:29.683 --> 01:02:32.854
l'm sure Zhao was the one
who ordered the attack on you.

539
01:02:36.524 --> 01:02:38.192
Any problems?

540
01:02:39.257 --> 01:02:42.630
We have arrived at the Northern
Water Tribe's stronghold.

541
01:02:42.762 --> 01:02:44.197
They believe the boy is there.

542
01:02:46.533 --> 01:02:48.436
Why do you seem upset, Uncle?

543
01:02:50.038 --> 01:02:52.240
Zhao has no sacredness.

544
01:02:52.804 --> 01:02:54.775
Are you sure you want to be here?

545
01:02:58.211 --> 01:03:02.721
l will not be allowed to live in peace
until l bring the Avatar to my father!

546
01:03:03.051 --> 01:03:04.784
ls that not clear to you?

547
01:04:15.122 --> 01:04:16.624
What is this?

548
01:04:17.959 --> 01:04:19.294
Yue...

549
01:04:21.130 --> 01:04:22.733
...the Fire Nation is here.

550
01:04:45.821 --> 01:04:48.994
Now be sure to keep your uniform
closed up to your neck.

551
01:04:49.326 --> 01:04:51.831
And remember, your Chi can warm you.

552
01:04:53.162 --> 01:04:54.564
l know, Uncle.

553
01:05:07.342 --> 01:05:08.679
Be safe.

554
01:06:11.643 --> 01:06:13.243
Aang needs to ask you something.

555
01:06:14.077 --> 01:06:16.314
l have to talk to the Dragon Spirit.

556
01:06:17.078 --> 01:06:19.083
He can help me defeat the Fire Nation.

557
01:06:20.251 --> 01:06:22.524
ls there a spiritual place
where l can meditate?

558
01:06:22.656 --> 01:06:27.194
There is a very spiritual place.
The city was built around this place.

559
01:06:27.991 --> 01:06:29.793
But we must hury.

560
01:06:49.648 --> 01:06:52.821
Momo, be nice.

561
01:06:55.453 --> 01:06:57.758
To get your Airbending tattoos,

562
01:06:57.888 --> 01:07:03.001
you have to meditate for long
periods of time without losing focus.

563
01:07:03.129 --> 01:07:07.135
Some of the great monks
can meditate for four days.

564
01:07:23.249 --> 01:07:26.119
- l have to get back.
- l'll take you.

565
01:07:28.687 --> 01:07:30.158
l'll stay with him.

566
01:07:50.508 --> 01:07:51.744
Aang?

567
01:07:54.515 --> 01:07:56.351
Aang, can you hear me?

568
01:07:59.520 --> 01:08:01.521
l knew you were real.

569
01:08:02.856 --> 01:08:05.693
l always knew you'd return.

570
01:08:06.691 --> 01:08:08.095
Me, too.

571
01:08:11.632 --> 01:08:13.369
The Fire Lord's son.

572
01:08:14.699 --> 01:08:16.805
You took him from our village.

573
01:08:43.163 --> 01:08:44.730
Who are you?

574
01:08:45.430 --> 01:08:47.033
My name is Katara,

575
01:08:47.167 --> 01:08:50.074
and l'm the only Waterbender left
in the Southern Water Tribe.

576
01:09:11.557 --> 01:09:13.493
- Go for the children.
- Yes.

577
01:09:26.939 --> 01:09:29.780
l'm not allowed to go home without him.

578
01:10:08.317 --> 01:10:10.721
The Waterbenders get power
from the moon.

579
01:10:10.853 --> 01:10:13.090
They will get stronger
as the day comes to an end.

580
01:10:14.891 --> 01:10:17.662
General Iroh,
l've been keeping a secret.

581
01:10:18.526 --> 01:10:19.929
And what is that?

582
01:10:20.328 --> 01:10:23.703
ln my raid of the Great Library
earlier this year,

583
01:10:23.832 --> 01:10:26.270
l found a scroll that tells

584
01:10:26.402 --> 01:10:28.972
the location
of the Ocean and Moon Spirits.

585
01:10:29.671 --> 01:10:32.275
To meet a Spirit would be a great honor.

586
01:10:36.379 --> 01:10:38.515
Well, l hope l can give you that honor.

587
01:11:19.388 --> 01:11:20.558
What happened?

588
01:11:22.224 --> 01:11:23.392
What happened?

589
01:11:24.160 --> 01:11:28.133
Prince Zuko's here in the city.
He took Aang again.

590
01:11:40.910 --> 01:11:43.849
We'll iust wait
till everyone's fighting everyone.

591
01:11:45.549 --> 01:11:48.254
Then in the night, we'll slip out.

592
01:11:49.752 --> 01:11:51.757
Aang, can you hear me?

593
01:11:55.259 --> 01:11:57.028
l knew you were real.

594
01:11:58.429 --> 01:12:01.269
l always knew you'd return.

595
01:12:03.665 --> 01:12:05.936
Hello! Hello!

596
01:12:08.839 --> 01:12:12.448
Please, tell me how
to beat the Fire Nation!

597
01:12:24.555 --> 01:12:28.830
You are not dealing
with the loss of your people,

598
01:12:28.960 --> 01:12:32.467
and your responsibility
for their deaths.

599
01:12:32.897 --> 01:12:35.636
You are stopping yourself
from grieving.

600
01:12:35.966 --> 01:12:37.636
You are angry.

601
01:12:37.969 --> 01:12:41.309
You must let this go.

602
01:12:42.007 --> 01:12:46.481
As the Avatar,
you are not meant to hurt others.

603
01:12:58.888 --> 01:13:00.156
Use the ocean.

604
01:13:01.326 --> 01:13:04.366
Show them the power of Water.

605
01:13:04.496 --> 01:13:08.004
Go! Do this now.

606
01:13:11.000 --> 01:13:14.942
My sister Azula
was always the special one.

607
01:13:15.540 --> 01:13:17.744
She was a Firebending prodigy.

608
01:13:17.877 --> 01:13:19.513
My father loves her.

609
01:13:27.852 --> 01:13:30.359
He can't even look at me sometimes.

610
01:13:32.493 --> 01:13:34.194
He says l'm like my mother.

611
01:14:27.114 --> 01:14:29.251
l advise that you
pull back your men soon.

612
01:14:29.383 --> 01:14:32.354
They will be trapped in the city
when the moon's power comes out.

613
01:14:32.485 --> 01:14:35.392
Do not worry about the moon's power,
General Iroh.

614
01:14:35.523 --> 01:14:37.628
Why should you not be worried
about the moon's power?

615
01:14:37.759 --> 01:14:39.929
Because your brother,
Fire Lord Ozai, and l

616
01:14:40.162 --> 01:14:44.000
have decided it is in our best
interests to kill the Moon Spirit.

617
01:14:45.098 --> 01:14:46.267
What?

618
01:16:07.847 --> 01:16:10.352
Calm down. We'll find him.

619
01:16:52.895 --> 01:16:56.135
Are you OK?
Did the Spirits tell you anything?

620
01:16:56.266 --> 01:17:00.240
Yes. The Dragon Spirit talked to me.
l know what to do.

621
01:17:00.904 --> 01:17:03.575
Aang, we have to go.

622
01:17:26.928 --> 01:17:29.601
You won't be killed by Waterbenders
if you stay hidden here.

623
01:17:33.103 --> 01:17:34.776
We could be friends, you know.

624
01:17:47.118 --> 01:17:49.020
They're getting stronger.

625
01:17:50.622 --> 01:17:54.963
This is a scroll from the Great Library.
This is our map.

626
01:17:55.759 --> 01:17:58.365
Our world is going to change soon,
gentlemen.

627
01:17:59.063 --> 01:18:00.833
Right there and right there.

628
01:18:23.920 --> 01:18:26.493
See where they're going!
l'll go join the fight!

629
01:18:48.846 --> 01:18:54.358
They are called many names:
Yin and Yang, push and pull.

630
01:18:55.189 --> 01:18:59.961
May l introduce you to the mysterious
Ocean and Moon Spirits?

631
01:19:16.608 --> 01:19:19.681
Why do Spirits take the form
of such benign things?

632
01:19:19.812 --> 01:19:22.716
lt leaves them so vulnerable.

633
01:19:22.849 --> 01:19:24.453
To teach man kindness and humility.

634
01:19:26.483 --> 01:19:28.455
Commander Zhao,

635
01:19:28.588 --> 01:19:32.262
there are certain things
humankind should not tamper with.

636
01:19:32.390 --> 01:19:34.729
The Spirits and the Spirit World
is one of them.

637
01:19:37.196 --> 01:19:38.967
What are you doing here?

638
01:19:39.099 --> 01:19:40.731
Stop, Zhao.

639
01:19:41.232 --> 01:19:45.008
The world will go out of balance.
Everyone will be hurt.

640
01:19:46.740 --> 01:19:51.117
The Fire Nation is too powerful

641
01:19:51.246 --> 01:19:55.085
to worry about children's superstitions,
General Iroh.

642
01:19:55.816 --> 01:19:59.021
Commander Zhao, don't.

643
01:20:07.592 --> 01:20:09.364
We are now the gods!

644
01:20:10.262 --> 01:20:11.599
No!

645
01:20:27.615 --> 01:20:30.052
Man all battle stations!

646
01:20:35.622 --> 01:20:38.193
You are too soft, General Iroh.

647
01:20:52.874 --> 01:20:55.479
He's making fire out of nothing!

648
01:21:20.837 --> 01:21:22.673
They're breaching the wall!

649
01:21:24.037 --> 01:21:25.809
To the front!

650
01:21:46.294 --> 01:21:50.703
As the Avatar,
you are not meant to hurt others.

651
01:21:51.600 --> 01:21:54.705
You must show them
the power of Water.

652
01:21:58.873 --> 01:22:00.677
All is lost.

653
01:22:02.111 --> 01:22:04.549
You have been anointed
by the Moon Spirit.

654
01:22:05.281 --> 01:22:10.022
- He gave me life when l was a child.
- Then there is still a chance.

655
01:22:11.050 --> 01:22:13.456
You can give your life
back for the Spirit's.

656
01:22:14.056 --> 01:22:18.364
- Don't listen to him, he's Fire Nation.
- Nothing is ever truly lost.

657
01:22:21.797 --> 01:22:27.007
- Is it mine to give back, if l choose?
- There are reasons each of us are born.

658
01:22:27.904 --> 01:22:30.175
We have to find those reasons.

659
01:22:39.248 --> 01:22:43.592
- This was the reason l was born.
- Yue, please.

660
01:22:44.921 --> 01:22:47.725
There is no love without sacrifice.

661
01:22:47.856 --> 01:22:50.730
Yue, what are you doing?
You don't know what will happen.

662
01:22:50.861 --> 01:22:54.299
l believe my life force will leave my
body and return to the Moon Spirit.

663
01:22:54.431 --> 01:22:55.466
And then what?

664
01:22:55.598 --> 01:22:58.137
My soul will no longer exist
in this form.

665
01:22:58.268 --> 01:23:01.406
Please don't do this.
There must be another way.

666
01:23:01.538 --> 01:23:03.976
l can't let you do this.
l'm supposed to protect you.

667
01:23:04.107 --> 01:23:06.244
My people are dying, Sokka.

668
01:23:06.377 --> 01:23:09.147
Those who are in charge of others
have a responsibility.

669
01:23:09.278 --> 01:23:12.018
lt is time we show the Fire Nation
we believe in our beliefs

670
01:23:12.148 --> 01:23:14.151
- as much as they believe in theirs.
- But Yue...

671
01:23:14.285 --> 01:23:18.458
l'm scared.
Don't make me any more scared.

672
01:23:20.457 --> 01:23:23.464
l will miss you more than you know.

673
01:25:00.894 --> 01:25:02.097
l killed you.

674
01:25:04.295 --> 01:25:06.365
Come away from him, nephew.

675
01:25:08.032 --> 01:25:10.104
There are too many soldiers now.

676
01:25:10.234 --> 01:25:13.008
They will never
Iet you take the Avatar.

677
01:25:13.974 --> 01:25:16.276
We must leave immediately.

678
01:25:16.840 --> 01:25:19.681
He wants to fight you
so he can capture you, Zuko.

679
01:25:20.646 --> 01:25:22.149
Walk away!

680
01:25:25.052 --> 01:25:26.253
Come!

681
01:25:58.352 --> 01:25:59.853
You stand alone.

682
01:26:00.753 --> 01:26:03.559
And that has always
been your great mistake.

683
01:28:01.408 --> 01:28:04.150
Water teaches us acceptance.

684
01:28:04.813 --> 01:28:09.356
Let your emotions flow like water.

685
01:32:13.732 --> 01:32:15.069
Aang?

686
01:33:17.468 --> 01:33:20.137
They want you to be their Avatar, Aang.

687
01:33:24.639 --> 01:33:26.143
We all do.

688
01:34:02.679 --> 01:34:06.385
Our forces in the Northern Water Tribe
have failed to take the city.

689
01:34:06.516 --> 01:34:09.388
General Zhao was killed in battle
and my brother has become a traitor.

690
01:34:09.520 --> 01:34:11.724
My son's proven himself a failure.

691
01:34:13.190 --> 01:34:18.465
Now, Sozin's Comet
is returning in three years.

692
01:34:18.596 --> 01:34:22.236
lt will give all Firebenders the ability
of the highest Firebenders,

693
01:34:22.366 --> 01:34:27.239
the ability to use their own Chi
to create Fire.

694
01:34:27.368 --> 01:34:31.579
That is the day we will win this war

695
01:34:31.709 --> 01:34:34.547
and prove the Fire Nation's dominance.

696
01:34:35.112 --> 01:34:39.752
Now you must stop the Avatar
from mastering Earth and Fire.

697
01:34:39.883 --> 01:34:42.888
You must give us the time
to get to that day.

698
01:34:43.885 --> 01:34:47.862
Do you accept this
unspeakably important task

699
01:34:47.990 --> 01:34:49.126
l'm putting in your hands?

700
01:34:55.733 --> 01:34:57.735
l do, Father.

701
01:35:01.656 --> 01:35:06.851
<i><b>Re-Sync by tebawihi</b></i>
